  "caption": "Taiwanese Hokkien enka in the classic Taigi chart style. Nylon-string guitar playing tremolo melody lines between phrases; accordion answering the vocal; a string section swelling into each chorus; a simple electric bass on roots and fifths; soft brushed drums in a slow steady 4/4. Wide warm production, strings and accordion forward, light hall reverb on the voice. A mature male baritone with controlled kobushi-style turns and vibrato at the ends of lines, never shouting. 76 BPM, A minor. Weathered, steady and quietly proud. No synth-pop beat, no autotune, no rock guitar solo, no rap, no EDM.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n透早五點 日頭猶未懸\n我穿雨鞋 行入鹽埕\n海水曝甲 一層白白\n柴耙推過去 沙沙咧響\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n三十个熱天 佇遮度過\n做伙的人 一个一个無來矣\n\n[Chorus]\n曝鹽 曝鹽\n日頭若火 鹽若霜\n一耙一耙 推做堆\n汗流落去 嘛是鹹的\n\n[Verse]\n九點遊覽車 停佇路邊\n少年人攑手機 來共我翕\n有一个囡仔 問阿伯\n這鹽 敢會使食\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n我共柴耙 交予伊\n教伊 腰愛向 跤愛在\n\n[Chorus]\n曝鹽 曝鹽\n日頭若火 鹽若霜\n囡仔推甲 規身軀白\n笑甲 比我較大聲\n\n[Bridge]\n鹽山堆甲 比人較懸\n風對海口 吹過來\n我閣推 一耙\n\n[Chorus]\n曝鹽 曝鹽\n日頭若火 鹽若霜\n明年熱天 猶原佇遮\n等恁閣來 推一耙\n\n[Outro]\n雨鞋脫落來 鹽埕猶原白白",
